            <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:800;color:#060c19;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em">Customer Total</span>
            <span style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:900;color:#b01616">$353.18</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:#6a7a8e;line-height:1.65;padding:12px 16px;background:#f0f2f7;border:1px solid rgba(30,50,80,0.07);border-radius:10px;margin:0">This was the total for this specific repair. Another WF45T6000AW with the same "not draining" complaint can require a completely different repair depending on the actual failure.</p>
      </div>

