      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(30,50,80,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:26px 28px">
        <h2 style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:1.12rem;font-weight:800;color:#060c19;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:-0.01em">
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</span>
          Samsung 5C or 5E Error Code
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 14px">If your WF45T6000AW is showing a 5C or 5E error, it means the washing machine detected a drainage problem. What it does not tell you is which part of the drainage system failed.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 14px">5C / 5E can be triggered by:</p>
