        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 14px">Samsung's own troubleshooting starts with the drain filter and drain hose before pump replacement.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0">A 5C or 5E code does not automatically mean you need a new pump.</p>
